  "description": "Keeps a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge web app up to date while the app is closed: a Shiny.Jobs background job checks the update provider, and new releases download through Shiny.Net.Http background transfers that survive the app being suspended or killed. Every download is verified exactly as a foreground one, and served from the next launch — so a required update rarely makes anyone wait at the splash screen. One call: bridge.AddWebAppAutoUpdate().",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
